# === AI session-manager runtime — DO NOT COMMIT ===
# Worker runtime state, transcripts, logs, PIDs, roster (contains session IDs).
# Source code (*.py + README) is committed; runtime data is not.
session_manager/sessions/
session_manager/audit.jsonl
session_manager/roster.json
session_manager/*.log
session_manager/*.pid

# === Raw AI session transcripts — DO NOT COMMIT ===
# stream.jsonl files contain tool_result blocks with whole-file contents,
# user paths, session IDs, and incidental secrets (e.g., webhook tokens
# captured in tool output). Substantive deliverables (absorption ledger,
# design docs, RESUME-MESSAGE-*.txt, STATUS.txt) stay committed alongside
# but are tracked individually.
**/_genesis-session/stream.jsonl
**/_genesis-session/manifest-*.tsv
**/_genesis-session/absorption-ledger*.tsv
**/_genesis-session/STAGE-B-completeness-table.tsv
**/_genesis-session/fullread-candidates.tsv
**/_genesis-session/_archive*/

# === Generic worker artifacts ===
*.pid
*.log

